sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Customer
  participant ACD as Contact center
  participant PSA as PSA Publisher
  participant P as Phone platform
  participant A as Priya
  C->>ACD: Calls the contact center
  ACD->>A: Delivers the call to Priya's phone
  ACD-->>PSA: Agent event: Working
  Note over PSA: Rule type Publisher, presence DND
  PSA->>P: Set Priya's presence to DND
  Note over P,A: Internal calls don't ring through
  C->>ACD: Hangs up
  ACD-->>PSA: Agent event: Available
  PSA->>P: Restore Priya's presence to Available
  Note over PSA,A: With Busy instead of DND, other calls still ring and Priya can decline or hold
